flowchart TD
    D[Invoice + Shipping + Certificate] --> N[Nutrient DWS Processor /build]
    N --> J[json-content + keyValuePairs]
    J --> E[Source-grounded evidence: page + bbox + confidence + value]
    E --> F[Fail-closed normalizer]
    F --> R[Deterministic reconciliation]
    R --> H[Human review binds exact finding/evidence slice]
    H --> M[Current Release Manifest]
    M --> C{Packet revision?}
    C -->|No| V[VERIFIED / REVIEW_REQUIRED / BLOCKED]
    C -->|Yes| N
    F --> DR[Differential Reverification]
    DR --> P{Current finding binding identical?}
    P -->|Yes| K[Preserve scoped review into NEW manifest]
    P -->|No| I[Invalidate prior review]
    K --> V
    I --> V
